message: "If you use this reproducibility package, please cite the archived release DOI and the associated manuscript when available."
title: "Source-Aware RTL Area and Timing Prediction: Reproducibility Package"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Rahman Aditta"
    given-names: "Arian"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AryanAditta/rtl-qor-source-aware-evaluation"
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - RTL
  - quality of results
  - area prediction
  - timing prediction
  - hardware design
  - EDA
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Curated reproducibility package for the manuscript "Source-Aware Evaluation
  of RTL Area and Timing Prediction with Prospective Confirmation." The
  repository contains compact frozen prediction-level data, manuscript-facing
  evidence tables, closure records and scripts for checking reported metrics,
  while deliberately excluding the full historical research archive and
  third-party RTL whose redistribution rights are uncertain.
